This story is a work of fiction.

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:37.440
July, 1590 - Sagami Province - Yuigahama

00:01:54.540 --> 00:01:55.850
What's the matter?

00:01:58.360 --> 00:02:01.270
Why don't we try to reproduce this scene of the waves hitting the sand

00:02:01.270 --> 00:02:03.750
with the ashes from the furnace?

00:02:26.030 --> 00:02:27.770
Come on, let's go.

00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:32.310
We have to reach Atami by sunset.

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:37.490
Goodness, Master.

00:02:37.770 --> 00:02:40.890
I thought I always considered my surroundings,

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:42.680
but I'm not at your level.

00:02:43.810 --> 00:02:48.540
Recently I've been focused on the small details.

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:54.260
Maybe death is approaching me?

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:58.600
The Shadow Tea King

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:14.890
I am very happy you invited me here to the ultimate hot springs.

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:19.630
Looks like I was right to ask the Chief Advisor for time off.

00:03:20.060 --> 00:03:25.130
This location in Kanto was made famous by Minamoto no Yoritomo.

00:03:25.770 --> 00:03:30.240
I've always wanted to come here after the war.

00:03:30.670 --> 00:03:34.370
Well, you have to head off to Ōu soon.

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:39.310
I shouldn't be bragging about completing my mission.

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:45.050
I may be returning to Kyoto in the middle of August.

00:03:45.480 --> 00:03:48.660
I need to hold a service for Sōji's books.

00:03:52.490 --> 00:03:55.180
I've talked with the other disciples.

00:03:55.940 --> 00:04:00.760
We'll hold a secret tea ceremony in Kyoto after things have calmed down.

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:04.890
We want to pay our last respects to Sōji.

00:04:06.090 --> 00:04:11.340
We can also use the chance to show you the Imayaki bowls from Mino.

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:14.840
Oh? What kind of tea bowls?

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:17.820
Please look forward to it.

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:30.940
I hope you can continue nurturing that creativity of yours, Lord Furuori.

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:39.490
I may notice the details, but my time is limited. You are to take my place.

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:44.090
W-What are you saying?

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:52.940
Karma is something that you can never get rid of.

00:04:54.450 --> 00:04:56.990
As I age, my karma diminishes.

00:04:57.500 --> 00:05:03.860
I thought I can create something for myself and live my last moments peacefully.

00:05:04.440 --> 00:05:06.100
But I was too naive.

00:05:07.550 --> 00:05:12.190
I cannot control myself anymore.

00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:20.580
My future lies only with the way of tea.

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:27.790
Please do not concern yourself with me anymore, Lord Furuori.

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:35.050
That is the only way for you to continue down the path of an aesthete.

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:53.520
What are you plotting...

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:10.420
I don't care what you do. I am with you until the very end.

00:06:15.190 --> 00:06:17.960
I am not as virtuous as you think I am.

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:22.080
Ever since that first time you invited me to your tea ceremony,

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:28.180
I understood that good and evil coexist within you.

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:33.340
Our late lord Nobunaga was the same, a monster.

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:39.510
That is why I decided to follow you.

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:43.210
I pay no mind to inhuman wit!

00:06:43.440 --> 00:06:46.870
I am willing to die with you for the sake of aesthetics!

00:06:49.850 --> 00:06:53.900
If you know about my evil deeds,

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:58.430
I do not think you will be able to forgive me.

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:04.120
You know nothing.

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:09.830
The deeds I committed to allow the rise of imperfection.

00:07:18.740 --> 00:07:20.900
I used the Chief Advisor

00:07:29.450 --> 00:07:33.060
to kill Lord Nobunaga.

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:50.340
You are merely a child.

00:07:51.060 --> 00:07:56.010
Just bear that feeling of hatred with you and forget about me.

00:07:57.440 --> 00:07:59.150
If you cannot do so,

00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:05.330
you will remain a child forever.

00:08:26.850 --> 00:08:30.350
August, 1590 - Kyoto - Jurakudai - Kita no Mandokoro Residence

00:08:31.260 --> 00:08:35.390
Come on, you two, no need to be so reserved.

00:08:36.170 --> 00:08:44.030
You get to marry someone as strong as Lord Ueda. I'm so jealous of you, Otoku!

00:08:44.810 --> 00:08:47.760
The Chief Advisor is coming back from Ōu.

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:50.120
I'm sure he'll be overjoyed!

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:56.080
Please take care of me.

00:08:56.530 --> 00:08:59.390
L-Likewise.

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:07.410
I am overjoyed to be able to marry Kita no Mandokoro's cousin, Madam Toku.

00:09:09.740 --> 00:09:16.360
Come on now, get closer together.

00:09:17.800 --> 00:09:24.280
Oh my goodness! What a match made in heaven!

00:09:30.760 --> 00:09:34.660
So we are holding off on the celebration until the Chief Advisor returns?

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:38.430
I wonder what I should give you?

00:09:39.100 --> 00:09:40.190
Please don't worry about that.

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:43.520
Have you seen Master since coming back from Odawara?

00:09:43.910 --> 00:09:45.670
No, not even once.

00:09:46.510 --> 00:09:49.270
I want him to teach me the essence of an aesthete.

00:09:49.910 --> 00:09:52.470
That's why I'll be visiting him soon.

00:09:53.950 --> 00:09:56.690
I have work to do now, so I'll be taking my leave.

00:10:07.310 --> 00:10:10.440
The Master is avoiding Lord Ueda, too?

00:10:11.830 --> 00:10:14.560
I cannot believe he was the man behind the Honnō-ji Incident...

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:18.940
But amazingly, I felt not one bit of hatred.

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:24.660
Only respect, like back then.

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:30.930
No, no, that's not all.

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:36.080
More like fear... I fear Sen no Rikyū.

00:10:38.630 --> 00:10:42.950
Like how we all kick aside pebbles in our way...

00:10:43.810 --> 00:10:45.940
The power of his karma is unapproachable.

00:10:48.190 --> 00:10:51.550
Is this the path to become an aesthete?

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:54.890
If I want to take over the heavens,

00:10:56.480 --> 00:11:00.330
then I'll have to eliminate those in my way?

00:11:17.450 --> 00:11:18.090
It must exist...

00:11:21.150 --> 00:11:23.190
I'm sure...

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:29.150
A path to sit on the throne of all aesthetes...

00:11:32.440 --> 00:11:36.310
That is the path I must take.

00:11:43.030 --> 00:11:45.620
Aren't you Lord Oribe?

00:11:45.820 --> 00:11:48.970
I'd have gone and visited if you had put out a word.

00:11:49.720 --> 00:11:51.640
I wanted to come see your store.

00:11:52.300 --> 00:11:56.790
This is quite simplistic.

00:11:58.090 --> 00:12:03.310
The people here at Kyoto were glaring at us during the construction.

00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:06.270
Did you receive the goods from Mino?

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:09.350
A few of the bowls you ordered have arrived.

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:12.260
Please take a look.

00:12:16.280 --> 00:12:18.900
I let those kids paint them,

00:12:19.040 --> 00:12:23.990
but that was just crazy. I'm surprised so many came in.

00:12:29.440 --> 00:12:34.830
That's from the kid throwing fertilizer around, Tamakichi.

00:12:35.170 --> 00:12:38.190
But his bowl came out not so bad.

00:12:57.520 --> 00:12:58.850
This is it, Shinbei!

00:12:59.310 --> 00:13:03.090
These YOLO brush strokes!

00:13:03.250 --> 00:13:07.710
In one instant, I've forgotten about all of my worries!

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:15.480
Display this prominently. Whatever happens, do not sell it to anyone.

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:22.600
A-A-Are you serious?

00:13:23.080 --> 00:13:26.850
Tamakichi isn't gonna paint anymore, of course.

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:29.620
He's just a brat.

00:13:29.940 --> 00:13:34.510
This is just a one-hit wonder.

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:39.540
Make this the blueprint and have the men and Mino make more!

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:44.850
Can you believe my vision?

00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:55.260
Please relax.

00:13:57.240 --> 00:13:59.710
Lord Mōri Terumoto.

00:14:00.380 --> 00:14:04.420
A tea room the size of two tatami mats naturally makes one uneasy.

00:14:06.250 --> 00:14:09.740
This is the very best tea room that I have designed.

00:14:10.210 --> 00:14:14.960
But His Highness has not approved of it.

00:14:18.390 --> 00:14:20.270
Please do not mind.

00:14:21.410 --> 00:14:26.190
I am not doing this for you secretly.

00:14:28.890 --> 00:14:30.910
You are about to invade China.

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:34.690
I'm sure all of the daimyo are on being very careful.

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:43.280
I suggested to the Chief Advisor to support all of you with tea ceremonies.

00:14:43.950 --> 00:14:47.760
You'll serve each and every one of us one by one?

00:14:53.050 --> 00:14:53.690
That's correct.

00:14:56.980 --> 00:15:00.030
You had a few disagreements with His Highness.

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:03.810
Do not think that I am afraid of him.

00:15:06.530 --> 00:15:10.430
I may be under the rule of Toyotomi,

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:15.200
but my unsurpassed courage will not diminish!

00:15:21.930 --> 00:15:27.820
As expected from the commander of 120,000 troops in Saigoku.

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:34.130
Daimyo of your caliber are few and far between after the fall of Hōjō.

00:15:40.020 --> 00:15:42.300
The Chief Advisor is getting old.

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:44.500
If something should happen,

00:15:44.910 --> 00:15:50.360
you may be the one to rule after the heavens.

00:16:02.210 --> 00:16:03.090
This is good tea.

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:05.880
The black tea bowl, too.

00:16:06.780 --> 00:16:09.680
I possess high quality Ido tea bowls,

00:16:10.020 --> 00:16:14.940
but this black Imayaki is the very essence of imperfection.

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:22.380
Lord Mōri is more aligned with imperfection than with refined elegance?

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:24.030
That's correct.

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:29.900
The view of the Itsukushima Shrine at high tide is a thing of utmost beauty.

00:16:31.410 --> 00:16:38.220
But the full sight of the Torii at low tide is even more unbelievable.

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:46.900
Please live in the midst of such wonders.

00:16:49.160 --> 00:16:52.900
My days are also numbered.

00:16:53.690 --> 00:16:58.120
I wish to live like that for the rest of my life,

00:16:58.650 --> 00:17:02.460
but these times do not allow for such luxuries.

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:12.970
The citizens who have lived through the ebb and flow of war and sutras also possess the same thoughts.

00:17:14.210 --> 00:17:21.000
I will change that tide, even if it costs me my life.

00:17:21.840 --> 00:17:24.790
That's why I'm telling you this, because you are a true aesthete.

00:17:25.460 --> 00:17:32.500
No, I am asking you because you are a man full of talent.

00:17:35.640 --> 00:17:37.720
I do not know the exact time.

00:17:38.180 --> 00:17:39.650
But when it happens,

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:44.160
can you respond to my invitation?

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:50.320
Of course.

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:05.320
Note: This is a list of daimyo. Rikyū is checking off Mōri Terumoto.

00:18:10.390 --> 00:18:13.980
Milord! An estimate for your armor is here.

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:20.600
Milord?

00:18:22.790 --> 00:18:23.760
What's the matter?

00:18:24.100 --> 00:18:26.950
Your old armor is beyond repair.

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:30.750
Ordering a new one is cheaper.

00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:37.580
Then I'll have a new one.

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:44.060
Did you buy that tea bowl?

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:48.520
N-No...

00:18:48.760 --> 00:18:49.960
I'm borrowing it.

00:18:50.200 --> 00:18:54.330
In these troubling times, I do not have the funds to waste on something like this.

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:05.980
She's surprisingly sharp.

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:08.150
This is amazing!

00:19:08.510 --> 00:19:14.000
It was worth it for me to come here to talk about maintaining your blades!

00:19:14.140 --> 00:19:19.800
I'll make the repair fee cheaper. Can you give me one of these?

00:19:20.170 --> 00:19:24.010
Can you sit normally before that?

00:19:48.940 --> 00:19:53.370
This will work! Master Koetsu, this will cause an uproar at tea ceremonies!

00:19:54.560 --> 00:19:57.030
Has Master Rikyū seen this yet?

00:19:59.820 --> 00:20:02.500
No, not yet...

00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:05.720
I want to see what he thinks!

00:20:05.940 --> 00:20:09.870
If Master Rikyū gives his seal of approval, then we'll have a treasure in our hands!

00:20:10.130 --> 00:20:14.740
A new wave of imperfection may be coming!

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:20.090
I want to ask him.

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:23.950
Even if the Master is hard to approach now...

00:20:25.190 --> 00:20:30.480
I want to confirm whether my aesthete's tastes are correct.

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:33.160
I cannot be afraid.

00:20:34.940 --> 00:20:35.590
No!

00:20:37.240 --> 00:20:43.410
I fear nothing with this!

00:20:54.370 --> 00:20:57.270
Nothing out of the ordinary, Your Highness.

00:20:58.630 --> 00:21:01.960
Are the tea ceremonies with the commanders progressing smoothly?

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:04.290
Yes.

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:09.170
Anything worth reporting to me?

00:21:15.770 --> 00:21:19.580
I've heard these strange rumors ever since I returned from Ōu.

00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:23.310
The commanders have been moving their funds around mysteriously.

00:21:24.590 --> 00:21:30.730
The invasion of China requires a lot of spending by each of the daimyo.

00:21:31.190 --> 00:21:37.770
Thus, me and the merchants of Sakai are using this chance to our advantage.

00:21:37.890 --> 00:21:40.030
We dealt some trades.

00:21:40.340 --> 00:21:42.970
This is how we survive.

00:21:43.000 --> 00:21:43.650
No!

00:21:44.480 --> 00:21:48.420
One of the goals of the invasion is to weaken the powers of each individual daimyo.

00:21:48.830 --> 00:21:51.620
You don't need to be helping them out in monetary matters.

00:21:52.130 --> 00:21:56.670
You are to only perform the tea ceremonies, and nothing else!

00:22:05.640 --> 00:22:07.150
I understand.

00:22:07.470 --> 00:22:09.450
Prove it not only with your words.

00:22:17.010 --> 00:22:23.700
You will give me that Hashitate tea pot, the famed treasure of simplicity, to me.

00:22:30.920 --> 00:22:32.180
And one more thing...

00:22:33.260 --> 00:22:36.360
you will give me your daughter, Ogin.

00:23:03.530 --> 00:23:06.260
Everytime I　

00:23:03.530 --> 00:23:06.260
Anata no mune

00:23:06.420 --> 00:23:08.650
feel your heart

00:23:06.420 --> 00:23:08.650
Fureru sonotabi

00:23:09.380 --> 00:23:14.740
Your burning, sincere passion singes me.

00:23:09.380 --> 00:23:14.740
Yakedoshisou na shinshi na jounetsu

00:23:15.660 --> 00:23:20.920
Were the world to turn against you, my dear love

00:23:15.660 --> 00:23:20.920
Sekai juu wo teki ni mawashitatte

00:23:21.770 --> 00:23:27.080
Oppose its rotation and return to me.

00:23:21.770 --> 00:23:27.080
Mezashitanara douzo tsuranuite kudasai

00:23:27.920 --> 00:23:33.170
Men are alike butterflies, as women are alike flowers.

00:23:27.920 --> 00:23:33.170
Otoko wa chouchou de onna wa hana de

00:23:34.170 --> 00:23:37.050
Through heaven and earth,

00:23:34.170 --> 00:23:37.050
Kuu to daichi to demo

00:23:37.280 --> 00:23:40.630
Are also alike, we all choose to live.

00:23:37.280 --> 00:23:40.630
Onaji asu wo eraberuno

00:23:40.830 --> 00:23:46.500
Should we be seperated by the flow of time?

00:23:40.830 --> 00:23:46.500
Toki ni nagasare kyouri ni hanasareru

00:23:46.600 --> 00:23:49.500
We must continue living our lives

00:23:46.600 --> 00:23:49.500
Kizuna nante kizunajynai

00:23:49.580 --> 00:23:52.110
Without each other.

00:23:49.580 --> 00:23:52.110
Omoumama ikite　

00:23:52.200 --> 00:23:53.070
You should

00:23:52.200 --> 00:23:53.070
Soshite

00:23:53.160 --> 00:23:58.570
Ascend the heavens and look below.

00:23:53.160 --> 00:23:58.570
Nobotta itadakikara mieru

00:23:58.680 --> 00:24:02.360
Show me the scenery in my dreams.

00:23:58.680 --> 00:24:02.360
Keshiki wo oshiete itsuka

00:24:02.420 --> 00:24:08.070
Even though we fall in love and drown in passion,

00:24:02.420 --> 00:24:08.070
Koi ni ochiteku ai ni oboreteku

00:24:08.150 --> 00:24:14.560
I desire my wish fulfilled, above this happiness we both share.

00:24:08.150 --> 00:24:14.560
Watashi no kono shiawase yori kanaetai negai sore wa

00:24:14.620 --> 00:24:20.360
I desire your pursuit of beautiful things.

00:24:14.620 --> 00:24:20.360
Anata no ou utsukushii mono

00:24:21.840 --> 00:24:26.340
So abide by my desire, for eternity.

00:24:21.840 --> 00:24:26.340
Kowasarenaide eien ni

00:24:34.240 --> 00:24:36.000
Die, Gamō!!

00:24:39.440 --> 00:24:41.200
I've finally become the devil.

00:24:47.700 --> 00:24:49.700
It's like what happened to Lord Nobunaga... All over again...

00:24:50.050 --> 00:24:53.040
The Crybaby Under the Sun.

00:24:53.720 --> 00:24:55.010
To be a warrior or an aesthete?

00:24:55.590 --> 00:24:58.080
That is the question.

00:24:56.310 --> 00:24:59.600
The Crybaby Under the Sun
